 ## Unreleased

+- Add optional limit and offset pagination to `GET /items`, with status 400 for invalid values.
 - Faster tag lookup.

 ## 1.4.2 - 2026-09-30
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 37fe697..ec4002e 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@ Current version: 1.4.2.

 ## Routes

-- `GET /items`: every item.
+- `GET /items`: every item, with optional `?limit=N&offset=M` pagination. `limit` is a whole number from 1 to 50; `offset` is a whole number from 0 (default 0). Omitting `limit` returns all remaining items. Invalid pagination returns status 400; successful responses remain arrays.
 - `GET /expiring`: items that expire within a week.
diff --git a/src/server.js b/src/server.js
